1
00:00:00,255 --> 00:00:02,659
A Greek goddess with almost no stories.

2
00:00:02,804 --> 00:00:04,780
And in Rome, keeper of the fire

3
00:00:04,591 --> 00:00:05,328
of Troy.

4
00:00:05,721 --> 00:00:07,763
Hestia is the firstborn of Cronus:

5
00:00:07,826 --> 00:00:09,342
the first child he swallows…

6
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,041
and the last he spits back out.

7
00:00:11,407 --> 00:00:13,909
Poseidon and Apollo both seek her hand.

8
00:00:14,032 --> 00:00:15,745
She touches the head of Zeus and

9
00:00:15,556 --> 00:00:17,445
swears to stay a maiden forever.

10
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:18,669
Her reward:

11
00:00:18,732 --> 00:00:20,072
the centre of the house.

12
00:00:20,206 --> 00:00:22,259
And at every banquet, wine is poured

13
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:23,783
to her, first and last.

14
00:00:24,189 --> 00:00:25,441
And that's nearly all.

15
00:00:25,586 --> 00:00:27,255
The Greek texts give her no more

16
00:00:27,066 --> 00:00:27,760
story.

17
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,196
Not even priests.

18
00:00:29,563 --> 00:00:30,717
Now, Rome.

19
00:00:30,861 --> 00:00:32,706
Vesta has the Vestal Virgins:

20
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,658
Numa gives them a public salary and

21
00:00:34,469 --> 00:00:35,733
makes them untouchable.

22
00:00:36,122 --> 00:00:37,670
Her fire comes from Troy:

23
00:00:37,778 --> 00:00:39,754
Hector's ghost hands it to Aeneas as

24
00:00:39,565 --> 00:00:40,697
the city burns.

25
00:00:41,097 --> 00:00:43,369
And the mother of Romulus, Rhea Silvia,

26
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:44,312
was a Vestal.

27
00:00:44,682 --> 00:00:46,669
So they're the same goddess by function:

28
00:00:46,743 --> 00:00:47,974
hearth and virginity.

29
00:00:48,089 --> 00:00:49,988
But they share not a single myth.

30
00:00:50,347 --> 00:00:52,236
Before you call them the same goddess,

31
00:00:52,211 --> 00:00:52,784
ask:

32
00:00:52,847 --> 00:00:54,122
which text says so?

33
00:00:54,514 --> 00:00:56,479
Save it, and send it to anyone

34
00:00:56,290 --> 00:00:58,146
who thinks Vesta is just the Roman

35
00:00:57,957 --> 00:00:58,683
Hestia.

